summary.label:
The APP controls the flight of the quadcopter through wireless WIFI image transmission technology.
It has the following functions:
1. Connect WIFI to control the flight of the aircraft through the joystick;
2. Display the real-time streaming picture of the aircraft camera;
3, take photos, video, view photos and videos;
4. Control the flight of the aircraft through gravity induction;
5. Automatic trajectory flight;
6. Voice-controlled flight;
7. Gesture recognition, taking photos and video;
8. VR mode;
9. Music video mode;
10. Video special effects mode.

Cool video player, Focus privacy protection.
Universal format, subtitle selection.
WiFi transmit video, easy upload video from the computer into the phone;
iTunes file sharing;
Play iCloud video;
Video password protection, easy to rename the file, easy to delete, multiple privacy protection;
Full-screen play, gesture operation, simple interface, easy to operate.

note:
1. The subtitle file and the media file need to have the same name, and the app will automatically recognize and load.
2. Files imported from iTunes can be seen after the file list is refreshed.
3. Also supports the playback of images, words, ppt, pdf and other documents.
